<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.13.1: Graphing Inequalities with Technology</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00604</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.13.1: Graphing Inequalities with Technology</md:title>
    <md:uuid>b6a08301-c9ef-496f-8b7b-db11a461ba92</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001">
      <title>Warm Up Activity</title>
      <div class="os-raise-familysupport">
        <para id="para-00001">Access the <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b62c9150250bf52d6cc37569213ab516e0090dca">Desmos guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
      </div>
      <para id="para-00002">Graph each inequality. Adjust the graphing window as needed to show meaningful information.</para>
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00001">
        <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y &gt; x \) using the Desmos tool below.</item>
      </list>
      <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500" height="400"/><example id="exam-00001">
        <exercise>
          <problem id="prob-00001">
            <!--QUESTION IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS-->
            <para id="para-00003">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00001">
            <para id="para-00004">Example:</para>
            <para id="para-00005">\(y &gt; x\)</para>
            <div>
              <figure id="fig-00001">
                <media alt="Graph of inequality. ">
                  <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_15_02_01.png"/>
                </media>
              </figure>
            </div>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
      </example>
      <!--Q2-->
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00002">
        <item> Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y \geq x \) using the Desmos tool below.</item>
      </list>
      <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500" height="400"/><example id="exam-00002">
        <exercise>
          <problem id="prob-00002">
            <!--QUESTION IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS-->
            <para id="para-00006">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00002">
            <para id="para-00007">Example:</para>
            <para id="para-00008">\( y \geq x \)
 </para>
            <div>
              <figure id="fig-00002">
                <media alt="Graph of inequality. ">
                  <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_15_02_02.png"/>
                </media>
              </figure>
            </div>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
      </example>
      <!--Q3-->
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00003">
        <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y&lt;\text-8 \) using the Desmos tool below.</item>
